{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1482323-aberrant-different-idea-for-elemental-mastery","id":1482323,"title":"[Aberrant] Different idea for Elemental Mastery","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-29T19:52:42-07:00","id":1482323,"title":"[Aberrant] Different idea for Elemental Mastery","content":"Hello all,<br /> <br /> I had a kind of epiphany this afternoon reading Scion and how flexible powers like the Purviews would work in Aberrant.<br /> <br /> It\u00b4s VERY crude yet, but the idea is base Elemental Mastery not in the Technique system, but in the Power Stunts system. In simple words, Elemental Mastery would have no base power, as described, but it would offer some good advantages wen power stunting with it. You can latter pick techniques to keep your favorite stunts easier to use, as any other power can, but the idea is that you don't have a first technique to pick.<br /> <br /> What kind of advantage when Power Stunting, you may ask, that's what I am not sure yet, but there are a few options that past by my mind. First option is to make it less quantum consuming, but power stunt now costs only 1 quantum point, so it would not be interesting. Second option is to give enhancements or add dice to the roll, but it could scale too fast. The third option was to allow the Nova to use the Tags he have in Elemental Mastery to change the stunt, for example, using more generic tags, you could add Area to make you power stunt affect more than a single target, or Might to add scale to the effect, or Ranged to make it possible to reach longer, but it may be part of what power stunting already is (very flexible). The last option is to make it easier by allowing the Nova to have as many dots as possible in it, not limited by quantum, as most powers, the Nova could start at Q1 and lots of power dots to better their chances to get many successes.<br /> <br /> Notice that the idea of Power Stunting is 1 success is for a minor effect, and 4 is truly massive, or 1 success per power dot. The character would be able to duplicate Mega Edges, Powers and other effects easier and with better results.<br /> <br /> The Power heading would be:<br /> <br /> Elemental Mastery<br /> Quantum Minimum: 1<br /> Action: Ordinary<br /> Cost: 1 Quantum point<br /> Dice Pool: Quantum + Power<br /> Range: Close<br /> Duration: Concentration<br /> <br /> Possible tags would be:<br /> Scale: The power has a higher scale than usual, still limited by quantum.<br /> Ranged: Increase the range of the effect.<br /> Area: Allow the effect to affect a larger area.<br /> Incendiary/Electric/Sonic: All the stunts have this tag for free, not needing to buy the result with successes.<br /> <br /> So, what do you guys think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-30T14:38:16-07:00","id":1482406,"title":"","content":"Adding some ideas. I think the best option is to keep the power working as the effects of power stunt and work with tags to make it more flexible.<br /> <br /> Power Stunting when not duplicating powers would have a limitation on range and duration (like Short range and Concentration) tags would allow you to use it with Elemental Mastery at longer range and without concentration.<br /> <br /> Tags would allow you to add specific tags to the duplicated power for free.<br /> <br /> A tag would allow you to do multiple power stunts at same time, like if it\u2019s all mixed actions. If you have too many active effects you are unable to do much more and need to just maintain those effects running.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 05-30-2022, 05:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Pos